ml":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§1.1, pp. 1–2; DjVu scans 9–10"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"1"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w,u,v\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w,u,v\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\le i\\le j\\le|w|\">\\(0\\le i\\le j\\le|w|\\)</span>。有限序列按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a> 从零编号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}word\\text{-}factors}\\vdash\nw[i:j]\\coloneqq\\langle w(i+k):0\\le k&lt;j-i\\rangle,\\qquad \\operatorname{pref}_i(w)\\coloneqq w[0:i],\\qquad \\operatorname{suff}_i(w)\\coloneqq w[i:|w|]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}word\\text{-}factors}\\vdash\nw[i:j]\\coloneqq\\langle w(i+k):0\\le k&lt;j-i\\rangle,\\qquad \\operatorname{pref}_i(w)\\coloneqq w[0:i],\\qquad \\operatorname{suff}_i(w)\\coloneqq w[i:|w|]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}word\\text{-}factors}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Prefix}(u,w)\\leftrightarrow\\exists v\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(w=uv),\\qquad \\operatorname{Suffix}(u,w)\\leftrightarrow\\exists v\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(w=vu)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}word\\text{-}factors}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Prefix}(u,w)\\leftrightarrow\\exists v\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(w=uv),\\qquad \\operatorname{Suffix}(u,w)\\leftrightarrow\\exists v\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(w=vu)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}word\\text{-}factors}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Factor}(u,w)\\leftrightarrow\\exists x,y\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(w=xuy),\\qquad w=w[0:i]w[i:j]w[j:|w|]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}word\\text{-}factors}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Factor}(u,w)\\leftrightarrow\\exists x,y\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(w=xuy),\\qquad w=w[0:i]w[i:j]w[j:|w|]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>截取的端点允许相等，因此空因子和空前缀都被包含。位置见证唯一确定结果。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$w,u,v\\in\\Sigma^*$，$i,j\\in\\mathbb N$，$0\\le i\\le j\\le|w|$。有限序列按 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]] 从零编号。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"w,u,v\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"0\\le i\\le j\\le|w|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}word\\text{-}factors}\\vdash\nw[i:j]\\coloneqq\\langle w(i+k):0\\le k<j-i\\rangle,\\qquad \\operatorname{pref}_i(w)\\coloneqq w[0:i],\\qquad \\operatorname{suff}_i(w)\\coloneqq w[i:|w|]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}word\\text{-}factors}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Prefix}(u,w)\\leftrightarrow\\exists v\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(w=uv),\\qquad \\operatorname{Suffix}(u,w)\\leftrightarrow\\exists v\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(w=vu)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}word\\text{-}factors}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Factor}(u,w)\\leftrightarrow\\exists x,y\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(w=xuy),\\qquad w=w[0:i]w[i:j]w[j:|w|]","display":true}],"bytes":1746,"backlinks":[{"id":"efcd33b278c102f5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$ 满足 $\\operatorname{CNF}(G)$，见 [[73-df-standard-cnf]]；$w\\in\\Sigma^*$、$n=|w|$，截取 $w[i:j]$ 见 [[73-df-word-factors]]。$i,j\\in\\mathbb N$；各递归子句另外满足所显示的区间条件，分割变量 $k$ 由有限并的整数下标绑定。$C_{G,w}$ 的递归按区间长度 $j-i$ 进行。"},{"id":"e19221f4363bbadf","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ce832179a6c70a34","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(K)$，$\\gamma\\in K^+$，$j,j'\\in\\mathbb N$，$j<|\\gamma|$；栈底在左、栈顶在右。$\\gamma'\\in K^*$，并满足 $(\\gamma'=\\varepsilon\\land j'=0)\\lor(\\gamma'\\ne\\varepsilon\\land j'<|\\gamma'|)$。有限词、截取见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]、[[73-df-word-factors]]。动作集合 $\\mathcal A_K$ 由下式定义，动作子句取 $\\alpha\\in\\mathcal A_K$。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-word-factors|词的截取、前缀与因子]]"}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780"]}